The files under `secrets/` (mode 0600) hold the only copy of the Dex client secret{{if .DNSCredentialWritten}} and of
the DNS credential you gave{{end}}{{if .Cloudflare}} and of the tunnel credentials{{end}}. Apply them, or encrypt them (sops,
